From 5fa7aaebbe7d081a88d888f3be39144e37411b06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: static white drawer at fixed gesture distances

Squashed from:
- 0009-static-white-drawer-at-distance-threshold
- 0010-use-shorter-fixed-drawer-gesture-distances

Change-Id: Ie10c2d21e4c386b1387706035247a10d1855284f

With config_staticAllApps the app drawer opens after 48dp of upward travel and closes after 32dp downward, without animation, on a flat white sheet with an outlined search field. Default off; the native drawer is unchanged.

